        'En\x20la\x20pausa,\x20la\x20Defensa\x20y\x20la\x20Defensa\x20Especial\x20de\x20los\x20Pokémon\x20con\x20naturaleza\x20salían\x20con\x20decimales\x20de\x20más\x20(55.00000000000001).': 'In\x20the\x20pause\x20screen,\x20Defense\x20and\x20Special\x20Defense\x20of\x20Pokémon\x20with\x20a\x20nature\x20showed\x20extra\x20decimals\x20(55.00000000000001).',
        'Móvil:\x20en\x20las\x20cartas\x20de\x20nivel\x20y\x20de\x20objeto\x20ya\x20no\x20queda\x20un\x20«·»\x20suelto\x20al\x20final\x20(era\x20el\x20de\x20las\x20teclas,\x20que\x20en\x20el\x20móvil\x20no\x20salen).\x20En\x20horizontal,\x20la\x20frase\x20del\x20título\x20ya\x20no\x20tapa\x20el\x20botón\x20Jugar,\x20y\x20en\x20la\x20ficha\x20de\x20la\x20colección\x20los\x20botones\x20de\x20Menta,\x20Cápsula\x20y\x20MT\x20vuelven\x20a\x20su\x20tamaño.': 'Mobile:\x20the\x20level-up\x20and\x20item\x20cards\x20no\x20longer\x20end\x20with\x20a\x20stray\x20\x22·\x22\x20(it\x20belonged\x20to\x20the\x20keyboard\x20keys,\x20which\x20are\x20not\x20shown\x20on\x20mobile).\x20In\x20landscape,\x20the\x20title\x20tagline\x20no\x20longer\x20covers\x20the\x20Play\x20button,\x20and\x20in\x20the\x20collection\x20page\x20the\x20Mint,\x20Capsule\x20and\x20TM\x20buttons\x20are\x20back\x20to\x20their\x20size.',
        'Móvil:\x20el\x20botón\x20«atrás»\x20(o\x20el\x20gesto\x20de\x20volver)\x20ya\x20no\x20te\x20saca\x20del\x20juego.\x20En\x20plena\x20partida\x20la\x20pausa,\x20en\x20una\x20pantalla\x20del\x20menú\x20vuelve\x20al\x20menú\x20y\x20sólo\x20en\x20el\x20menú\x20principal\x20sale\x20de\x20la\x20web.\x20Y\x20si\x20bajas\x20la\x20cortina\x20de\x20avisos\x20u\x20otra\x20app\x20se\x20pone\x20por\x20encima,\x20la\x20partida\x20también\x20se\x20pausa\x20(jugando\x20solo).': 'Mobile:\x20the\x20\x22back\x22\x20button\x20(or\x20the\x20back\x20gesture)\x20no\x20longer\x20takes\x20you\x20out\x20of\x20the\x20game.\x20During\x20a\x20run\x20it\x20pauses,\x20on\x20a\x20menu\x20screen\x20it\x20goes\x20back\x20to\x20the\x20menu,\x20and\x20only\x20on\x20the\x20main\x20menu\x20does\x20it\x20leave\x20the\x20site.\x20And\x20if\x20you\x20pull\x20down\x20the\x20notification\x20shade\x20or\x20another\x20app\x20opens\x20on\x20top,\x20the\x20run\x20also\x20pauses\x20(when\x20playing\x20solo).',
        'La\x20barra\x20de\x20arriba\x20(monedas,\x20tickets,\x20caramelos,\x20tu\x20nombre\x20y\x20los\x20botones)\x20cabe\x20en\x20cualquier\x20pantalla.\x20Antes,\x20con\x20todo\x20puesto,\x20en\x20muchas\x20pantallas\x20(también\x20tabletas)\x20las\x20monedas\x20y\x20los\x20tickets\x20se\x20salían\x20por\x20la\x20izquierda\x20y\x20los\x20botones\x20se\x20partían\x20en\x20dos\x20líneas.\x20Ahora,\x20si\x20no\x20hay\x20sitio,\x20los\x20botones\x20se\x20quedan\x20sólo\x20con\x20su\x20icono,\x20tu\x20nombre\x20se\x20recorta\x20y\x20las\x20cantidades\x20muy\x20grandes\x20salen\x20en\x20corto\x20(10\x20M).': 'The\x20top\x20bar\x20(coins,\x20tickets,\x20candy,\x20your\x20name\x20and\x20the\x20buttons)\x20fits\x20on\x20any\x20screen.\x20Before,\x20with\x20everything\x20showing,\x20on\x20many\x20screens\x20(tablets\x20too)\x20the\x20coins\x20and\x20tickets\x20went\x20off\x20the\x20left\x20edge\x20and\x20the\x20buttons\x20split\x20into\x20two\x20lines.\x20Now,\x20when\x20space\x20is\x20short,\x20the\x20buttons\x20keep\x20only\x20their\x20icon,\x20your\x20name\x20is\x20shortened\x20and\x20very\x20large\x20amounts\x20are\x20shown\x20short\x20(10M).',
