        'Móvil\x20y\x20tableta:\x20nuevo\x20joystick\x20«Anclado»\x20(Ajustes\x20→\x20Controles\x20→\x20Colocar\x20los\x20botones).\x20Aparece\x20donde\x20pones\x20el\x20dedo\x20y\x20se\x20queda\x20en\x20ese\x20sitio\x20mientras\x20lo\x20mantienes,\x20aunque\x20alejes\x20el\x20dedo;\x20al\x20levantarlo\x20y\x20tocar\x20en\x20otro\x20sitio,\x20aparece\x20allí.\x20El\x20«Flotante»\x20de\x20siempre\x20sigue\x20al\x20dedo\x20y\x20sigue\x20siendo\x20el\x20que\x20viene\x20puesto.': 'Mobile\x20and\x20tablet:\x20new\x20\x22Anchored\x22\x20joystick\x20(Settings\x20→\x20Controls\x20→\x20Place\x20the\x20buttons).\x20It\x20appears\x20where\x20you\x20put\x20your\x20finger\x20and\x20stays\x20in\x20that\x20spot\x20while\x20you\x20hold\x20it,\x20even\x20if\x20you\x20move\x20your\x20finger\x20away;\x20lift\x20it\x20and\x20touch\x20somewhere\x20else,\x20and\x20it\x20appears\x20there.\x20The\x20usual\x20\x22Floating\x22\x20one\x20follows\x20your\x20finger\x20and\x20is\x20still\x20the\x20default.',
        'Ranking:\x20desde\x20la\x20noche\x20del\x2026\x20de\x20octubre,\x20muchas\x20partidas\x20no\x20entraban\x20en\x20el\x20ranking\x20(en\x20el\x20perfil\x20sí\x20salían).\x20Ahora\x20el\x20juego\x20insiste\x20más\x20al\x20prepararlas\x20para\x20el\x20ranking\x20y\x20entran\x20como\x20siempre.': 'Leaderboard:\x20since\x20the\x20night\x20of\x20October\x2026,\x20many\x20runs\x20did\x20not\x20make\x20it\x20into\x20the\x20leaderboard\x20(they\x20did\x20show\x20in\x20your\x20profile).\x20The\x20game\x20now\x20tries\x20harder\x20when\x20preparing\x20them\x20for\x20the\x20leaderboard\x20and\x20they\x20get\x20in\x20as\x20usual.',
