        'new': [['38\x20ataques\x20nuevos:\x20ahora\x20todos\x20los\x20tipos\x20tienen\x205\x20o\x20más\x20(Roca,\x20Lucha,\x20Dragón\x20y\x20Hada\x20tenían\x20sólo\x202).\x20Entre\x20ellos\x20Hiperrayo,\x20Rayo\x20Solar,\x20Magnitud,\x20Torbellino,\x20Onda\x20Trueno,\x20Enfado,\x20Carantoña,\x20Golpe\x20Bajo...\x20cada\x20uno\x20con\x20su\x20evolución.', '38\x20new\x20moves:\x20every\x20type\x20now\x20has\x205\x20or\x20more\x20(Rock,\x20Fighting,\x20Dragon\x20and\x20Fairy\x20had\x20only\x202).\x20Among\x20them\x20Hyper\x20Beam,\x20Solar\x20Beam,\x20Magnitude,\x20Whirlpool,\x20Thunder\x20Wave,\x20Outrage,\x20Play\x20Rough,\x20Sucker\x20Punch...\x20each\x20with\x20its\x20evolution.'], ['Formas\x20nuevas\x20de\x20atacar:\x20disparos\x20que\x20persiguen\x20al\x20enemigo\x20o\x20rebotan\x20entre\x20ellos,\x20rayos\x20que\x20se\x20cargan,\x20giros\x20que\x20golpean\x20todo\x20alrededor,\x20ondas\x20que\x20avanzan\x20por\x20el\x20suelo,\x20remolinos\x20que\x20atraen\x20a\x20los\x20enemigos,\x20ondas\x20que\x20los\x20apartan\x20y\x20zonas\x20que\x20los\x20dejan\x20aturdidos.', 'New\x20ways\x20to\x20attack:\x20shots\x20that\x20chase\x20enemies\x20or\x20bounce\x20between\x20them,\x20beams\x20you\x20charge\x20up,\x20spins\x20that\x20hit\x20everything\x20around\x20you,\x20shockwaves\x20that\x20travel\x20along\x20the\x20ground,\x20vortexes\x20that\x20pull\x20enemies\x20in,\x20waves\x20that\x20push\x20them\x20away\x20and\x20zones\x20that\x20stun\x20them.'], [_0x3aa2e2(0x842), 'New\x20upgrade,\x20Starting\x20move:\x20buy\x20it\x20once\x20per\x20Pokémon\x20and\x20then\x20choose\x20for\x20free\x20which\x20move\x20it\x20starts\x20the\x20run\x20with.'], ['Idiomas\x20nuevos:\x20francés,\x20italiano,\x20portugués\x20de\x20Brasil,\x20chino\x20simplificado\x20y\x20chino\x20tradicional,\x20en\x20Ajustes\x20>\x20Gráficos\x20>\x20Idioma.\x20Gracias\x20a\x20quienes\x20los\x20tradujeron.', 'New\x20languages:\x20French,\x20Italian,\x20Brazilian\x20Portuguese,\x20Simplified\x20Chinese\x20and\x20Traditional\x20Chinese,\x20in\x20Settings\x20>\x20Graphics\x20>\x20Language.\x20Thanks\x20to\x20everyone\x20who\x20translated\x20them.'], ['Una\x20frase\x20de\x20broma\x20en\x20el\x20título\x20del\x20menú\x20principal,\x20como\x20las\x20de\x20Minecraft.', 'A\x20joke\x20line\x20on\x20the\x20main\x20menu\x20title,\x20like\x20the\x20ones\x20in\x20Minecraft.']],
        'chg': [['Los\x20Pokémon\x20de\x20un\x20solo\x20tipo\x20pegan\x20un\x2020\x20%\x20más\x20con\x20los\x20ataques\x20de\x20su\x20tipo,\x20para\x20compensar\x20que\x20tienen\x20menos\x20variedad.', 'Single-type\x20Pokémon\x20deal\x2020%\x20more\x20damage\x20with\x20moves\x20of\x20their\x20type,\x20to\x20make\x20up\x20for\x20having\x20less\x20variety.'], ['Al\x20aprender\x20un\x20ataque\x20nuevo\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20cambia\x20solo\x20a\x20él:\x20sigues\x20con\x20el\x20que\x20estabas\x20usando\x20y\x20cambias\x20cuando\x20tú\x20quieras.', 'Learning\x20a\x20new\x20move\x20no\x20longer\x20switches\x20to\x20it\x20on\x20its\x20own:\x20you\x20keep\x20the\x20one\x20you\x20were\x20using\x20and\x20switch\x20whenever\x20you\x20want.'], ['El\x20juego\x20sólo\x20se\x20puede\x20jugar\x20en\x20su\x20web\x20oficial,\x20pokesurvivor.com:\x20si\x20otra\x20web\x20lo\x20mete\x20dentro\x20de\x20la\x20suya\x20(por\x20ejemplo,\x20para\x20ponerle\x20anuncios\x20alrededor),\x20sale\x20un\x20aviso\x20con\x20un\x20botón\x20para\x20ir\x20a\x20la\x20oficial.', _0x3aa2e2(0x396)]],
        'fix': [['Movimiento\x20inicial:\x20ya\x20se\x20puede\x20volver\x20al\x20ataque\x20de\x20serie\x20aunque\x20no\x20sea\x20de\x20su\x20tipo\x20(por\x20ejemplo\x20Confusión\x20en\x20Psyduck).', 'Starting\x20move:\x20you\x20can\x20now\x20go\x20back\x20to\x20the\x20default\x20move\x20even\x20if\x20it\x20is\x20not\x20of\x20its\x20type\x20(for\x20example\x20Confusion\x20on\x20Psyduck).'], ['Cooperativo:\x20el\x20jefe\x20que\x20tocaba\x20al\x20volver\x20de\x20una\x20grieta\x20podía\x20salir\x20a\x20miles\x20de\x20metros,\x20donde\x20nadie\x20lo\x20encontraba,\x20y\x20la\x20partida\x20se\x20quedaba\x20sin\x20más\x20grietas.\x20Ahora\x20sale\x20cerca,\x20y\x20si\x20un\x20jefe\x20se\x20queda\x20lejísimos\x20de\x20todos,\x20vuelve\x20a\x20aparecer\x20cerca\x20a\x20los\x20pocos\x20segundos.', 'Co-op:\x20the\x20boss\x20due\x20when\x20coming\x20back\x20from\x20a\x20rift\x20could\x20appear\x20thousands\x20of\x20metres\x20away,\x20where\x20nobody\x20could\x20find\x20it,\x20and\x20the\x20run\x20got\x20no\x20more\x20rifts.\x20Now\x20it\x20appears\x20nearby,\x20and\x20if\x20a\x20boss\x20ends\x20up\x20very\x20far\x20from\x20everyone,\x20it\x20shows\x20up\x20close\x20again\x20after\x20a\x20few\x20seconds.'], ['Al\x20recargar,\x20a\x20veces\x20la\x20página\x20nueva\x20se\x20juntaba\x20con\x20los\x20estilos\x20viejos\x20guardados\x20en\x20el\x20navegador\x20(por\x20ejemplo,\x20la\x20frase\x20del\x20título\x20salía\x20en\x20grande\x20pegada\x20a\x20«PokéSurvivor»).\x20Ya\x20no\x20pasa.', 'When\x20reloading,\x20the\x20new\x20page\x20sometimes\x20got\x20mixed\x20with\x20the\x20old\x20styles\x20saved\x20in\x20the\x20browser\x20(for\x20example,\x20the\x20title\x20line\x20showed\x20up\x20big\x20and\x20stuck\x20to\x20\x22PokéSurvivor\x22).\x20That\x20no\x20longer\x20happens.']]
