        'chg': [['Las\x20cartas\x20de\x20nivel,\x20de\x20vínculo\x20y\x20de\x20objeto\x20no\x20se\x20pueden\x20elegir\x20durante\x20un\x20momento\x20al\x20aparecer\x20(se\x20ven\x20apagadas):\x20pulsar\x201-4\x20o\x20tocar\x20la\x20pantalla\x20para\x20cambiar\x20de\x20ataque\x20en\x20plena\x20pelea\x20ya\x20no\x20elige\x20una\x20carta\x20sin\x20querer.', 'Level-up,\x20bond\x20and\x20item\x20cards\x20can’t\x20be\x20picked\x20for\x20a\x20moment\x20after\x20they\x20appear\x20(they\x20look\x20dimmed):\x20pressing\x201-4\x20or\x20tapping\x20to\x20switch\x20attacks\x20mid-fight\x20no\x20longer\x20picks\x20a\x20card\x20by\x20accident.'], ['Con\x20mando\x20ya\x20se\x20pueden\x20elegir\x20en\x20la\x20colección\x20los\x20Pokémon\x20que\x20aún\x20no\x20tienes,\x20y\x20en\x20el\x20móvil\x20las\x20pestañas\x20de\x20Ajustes\x20caben\x20en\x20una\x20fila\x20que\x20se\x20desliza.', 'With\x20a\x20controller\x20you\x20can\x20now\x20select\x20the\x20Pokémon\x20you\x20don’t\x20have\x20yet\x20in\x20the\x20collection,\x20and\x20on\x20mobile\x20the\x20Settings\x20tabs\x20fit\x20in\x20one\x20row\x20that\x20scrolls\x20sideways.'], ['La\x20partida\x20se\x20guarda\x20en\x20la\x20nube\x20automáticamente\x20cada\x2010\x20minutos.', 'Your\x20game\x20is\x20saved\x20to\x20the\x20cloud\x20automatically\x20every\x2010\x20minutes.'], ['Ranking\x20histórico:\x20si\x20estás\x20por\x20debajo\x20del\x20puesto\x201.000,\x20sale\x20«#1000+»\x20en\x20vez\x20del\x20número\x20exacto.', 'All-time\x20leaderboard:\x20if\x20you\x20are\x20below\x20rank\x201,000,\x20it\x20shows\x20“#1000+”\x20instead\x20of\x20the\x20exact\x20number.'], ['Los\x20Pokémon\x20grandes\x20(Onix,\x20Gyarados,\x20Wailord,\x20Eternatus,\x20los\x20legendarios...)\x20ya\x20se\x20pueden\x20jugar\x20bien:\x20se\x20ven\x20algo\x20más\x20pequeños,\x20aunque\x20siguen\x20siendo\x20de\x20los\x20más\x20grandes,\x20y\x20chocan\x20como\x20uno\x20normal,\x20así\x20que\x20caben\x20por\x20todos\x20los\x20pasillos\x20y\x20no\x20reciben\x20más\x20golpes\x20por\x20su\x20tamaño.', _0x3aa2e2(0x1bc)], ['Como\x20mucho\x20hay\x203\x20curanderos,\x203\x20escuderos\x20y\x203\x20invocadores\x20a\x20la\x20vez.', 'There\x20are\x20at\x20most\x203\x20healers,\x203\x20shielders\x20and\x203\x20summoners\x20at\x20a\x20time.'], ['Los\x20curanderos\x20y\x20escuderos\x20ya\x20no\x20hacen\x20inmatable\x20a\x20un\x20jefe:\x20lo\x20que\x20le\x20curan\x20y\x20el\x20escudo\x20que\x20le\x20ponen\x20van\x20con\x20el\x20daño\x20que\x20le\x20estás\x20haciendo,\x20y\x20sólo\x20recibe\x20un\x20escudo\x20cada\x206\x20segundos.', 'Healers\x20and\x20shielders\x20no\x20longer\x20make\x20a\x20boss\x20unkillable:\x20their\x20healing\x20and\x20shields\x20scale\x20with\x20the\x20damage\x20you\x20are\x20dealing\x20to\x20it,\x20and\x20it\x20only\x20gets\x20one\x20shield\x20every\x206\x20seconds.'], ['Sentencia\x20de\x20Arceus:\x20la\x20velocidad\x20tiene\x20un\x20tope\x20suave\x20(lo\x20que\x20pase\x20de\x20cierto\x20punto\x20cuenta\x20mucho\x20menos)\x20y\x20los\x20legendarios\x20corren\x20casi\x20tanto\x20como\x20tú.\x20Desde\x20los\x205\x20minutos\x20de\x20Sentencia\x20Arceus\x20acelera\x20sin\x20parar,\x20y\x20desde\x20los\x207\x20su\x20toque\x20quita\x20cada\x20vez\x20más\x20vida,\x20hasta\x20dejarte\x20KO\x20de\x20un\x20golpe\x20hacia\x20el\x20minuto\x2040.', 'Judgment\x20of\x20Arceus:\x20speed\x20has\x20a\x20soft\x20cap\x20(anything\x20above\x20a\x20certain\x20point\x20counts\x20much\x20less)\x20and\x20legendaries\x20run\x20almost\x20as\x20fast\x20as\x20you.\x20After\x205\x20minutes\x20of\x20Judgment,\x20Arceus\x20keeps\x20speeding\x20up,\x20and\x20after\x207\x20its\x20touch\x20takes\x20more\x20and\x20more\x20HP,\x20until\x20it\x20knocks\x20you\x20out\x20in\x20one\x20hit\x20around\x20minute\x2040.'], ['El\x20veneno\x20sigue\x20quitando\x20un\x20porcentaje\x20de\x20la\x20vida,\x20pero\x20contra\x20enemigos\x20con\x20muchísima\x20vida\x20(los\x20legendarios\x20de\x20la\x20Sentencia)\x20ese\x20porcentaje\x20es\x20menor.', 'Poison\x20still\x20takes\x20a\x20percentage\x20of\x20HP,\x20but\x20against\x20enemies\x20with\x20huge\x20HP\x20(the\x20Judgment\x20legendaries)\x20that\x20percentage\x20is\x20smaller.'], ['Todos\x20los\x20rankings\x20empiezan\x20de\x20cero\x20(hoy,\x20semana,\x20mes,\x20año\x20e\x20histórico):\x20las\x20marcas\x20de\x20huir\x20de\x20Arceus\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20podrían\x20alcanzar.', 'All\x20leaderboards\x20start\x20from\x20scratch\x20(daily,\x20weekly,\x20monthly,\x20yearly\x20and\x20all-time):\x20records\x20from\x20running\x20away\x20from\x20Arceus\x20could\x20no\x20longer\x20be\x20reached.']],
        'fix': [['Seguridad:\x20se\x20ha\x20cerrado\x20un\x20agujero\x20por\x20el\x20que\x20alguien\x20podía\x20meter\x20código\x20en\x20su\x20fila\x20del\x20ranking\x20o\x20en\x20su\x20perfil\x20y\x20hacer\x20que\x20se\x20ejecutara\x20en\x20el\x20navegador\x20de\x20quien\x20los\x20abría\x20(a\x20algunos\x20les\x20llevaba\x20a\x20un\x20vídeo).\x20Ahora\x20todo\x20lo\x20que\x20viene\x20de\x20otros\x20jugadores\x20se\x20limpia,\x20el\x20servidor\x20sólo\x20deja\x20guardar\x20lo\x20que\x20debe,\x20y\x20el\x20navegador\x20no\x20ejecuta\x20nada\x20que\x20no\x20sea\x20del\x20juego.', 'Security:\x20we\x20closed\x20a\x20hole\x20that\x20let\x20someone\x20put\x20code\x20in\x20their\x20leaderboard\x20row\x20or\x20profile\x20and\x20make\x20it\x20run\x20in\x20the\x20browser\x20of\x20whoever\x20opened\x20them\x20(some\x20people\x20were\x20sent\x20to\x20a\x20video).\x20Now\x20everything\x20coming\x20from\x20other\x20players\x20is\x20cleaned,\x20the\x20server\x20only\x20accepts\x20what\x20it\x20should,\x20and\x20the\x20browser\x20runs\x20nothing\x20that\x20isn’t\x20part\x20of\x20the\x20game.'], ['En\x20el\x20ranking\x20ya\x20salen\x20en\x20shiny\x20los\x20Pokémon\x20de\x20quien\x20jugó\x20con\x20su\x20shiny.', 'The\x20leaderboard\x20now\x20shows\x20Pokémon\x20in\x20shiny\x20form\x20for\x20players\x20who\x20played\x20with\x20their\x20shiny.']]
