        'new': [['La\x20Sentencia\x20de\x20Arceus:\x20al\x20llegar\x20al\x20minuto\x2030,\x20Arceus\x20baja\x20del\x20cielo\x20y\x20te\x20lleva\x20a\x20las\x20Ruinas\x20del\x20Juicio.\x20Es\x20invencible,\x20te\x20persigue\x20cada\x20vez\x20más\x20deprisa\x20y\x20lanza\x20pilares\x20de\x20luz,\x20rayos\x20y\x20ondas;\x20si\x20te\x20toca,\x20te\x20quita\x20casi\x20media\x20vida.\x20Cada\x205\x20segundos\x20acude\x20un\x20legendario\x20con\x20el\x20doble\x20de\x20vida\x20y\x20de\x20daño\x20que\x20el\x20anterior.\x20¿Cuánto\x20aguantarás?', _0x3aa2e2(0x182)], ['Tres\x20logros\x20nuevos:\x20La\x20Sentencia\x20(llega\x20al\x20minuto\x2030),\x20Ante\x20el\x20Creador\x20(aguanta\x201\x20minuto\x20ante\x20Arceus)\x20y\x20Desafío\x20divino\x20(derrota\x20a\x203\x20legendarios\x20ante\x20Arceus\x20en\x20una\x20partida).', 'Three\x20new\x20achievements:\x20The\x20Judgment\x20(reach\x20minute\x2030),\x20Before\x20the\x20Creator\x20(survive\x201\x20minute\x20against\x20Arceus)\x20and\x20Divine\x20challenge\x20(defeat\x203\x20legendaries\x20against\x20Arceus\x20in\x20a\x20single\x20run).'], [_0x3aa2e2(0x2c5), 'New\x20music\x20for\x20the\x20fight\x20against\x20Arceus.'], ['Botón\x20para\x20reportar\x20marcas\x20sospechosas\x20en\x20el\x20ranking\x20(la\x20banderita\x20de\x20cada\x20fila).', 'A\x20button\x20to\x20report\x20suspicious\x20records\x20on\x20the\x20leaderboard\x20(the\x20little\x20flag\x20on\x20each\x20row).']],
        'chg': [['El\x20ranking\x20histórico\x20empieza\x20de\x20cero:\x20ahora\x20que\x20las\x20partidas\x20acaban\x20ante\x20Arceus,\x20las\x20marcas\x20de\x20antes\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20podrían\x20alcanzar.\x20Las\x20tablas\x20de\x20hoy,\x20de\x20la\x20semana\x20y\x20del\x20mes\x20siguen\x20igual.', 'The\x20all-time\x20leaderboard\x20starts\x20from\x20scratch:\x20now\x20that\x20runs\x20end\x20against\x20Arceus,\x20older\x20records\x20could\x20no\x20longer\x20be\x20reached.\x20The\x20daily,\x20weekly\x20and\x20monthly\x20boards\x20are\x20unchanged.'], [_0x3aa2e2(0x62e), 'Overtime\x20from\x20minute\x2060\x20is\x20removed\x20(runs\x20no\x20longer\x20get\x20that\x20far).'], ['Desde\x20el\x20minuto\x2028\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20abren\x20grietas,\x20para\x20que\x20la\x20Sentencia\x20no\x20te\x20pille\x20dentro\x20de\x20una.', 'Rifts\x20no\x20longer\x20open\x20from\x20minute\x2028\x20on,\x20so\x20the\x20Judgment\x20does\x20not\x20catch\x20you\x20inside\x20one.'], ['Ranking\x20protegido\x20contra\x20trampas:\x20el\x20servidor\x20comprueba\x20que\x20cada\x20marca\x20se\x20ha\x20jugado\x20de\x20verdad.\x20Nunca\x20se\x20pierde\x20nada\x20de\x20lo\x20que\x20ganas\x20jugando.', _0x3aa2e2(0x3db)], ['Se\x20han\x20quitado\x20del\x20ranking\x20las\x20marcas\x20de\x20más\x20de\x2035\x20minutos:\x20con\x20la\x20Sentencia\x20de\x20Arceus\x20ya\x20no\x20son\x20posibles.', 'Records\x20over\x2035\x20minutes\x20have\x20been\x20removed\x20from\x20the\x20leaderboard:\x20with\x20the\x20Judgment\x20of\x20Arceus\x20they\x20are\x20no\x20longer\x20possible.']],
        'fix': [['Las\x20tiradas\x20del\x20gacha,\x20los\x20Pokémon\x20nuevos\x20y\x20los\x20premios\x20se\x20guardan\x20en\x20la\x20nube\x20al\x20momento.\x20Si\x20abriste\x20el\x20juego\x20en\x20otro\x20aparato\x20o\x20navegador\x20y\x20te\x20faltaba\x20algo,\x20vuelve\x20a\x20abrirlo\x20donde\x20lo\x20conseguiste:\x20se\x20recupera\x20solo.', 'Gacha\x20pulls,\x20new\x20Pokémon\x20and\x20rewards\x20are\x20saved\x20to\x20the\x20cloud\x20right\x20away.\x20If\x20you\x20opened\x20the\x20game\x20on\x20another\x20device\x20or\x20browser\x20and\x20something\x20was\x20missing,\x20open\x20it\x20again\x20where\x20you\x20got\x20it:\x20it\x20comes\x20back\x20on\x20its\x20own.']]
